///////////Location: Noticeboards/////////////

SCRIPT:NoticeboardCat_Beacons
"Missing cat:\nBlack and lean with green eyes\nReward for safe return to the White Swan Inn\nNo imposters!"
END

SCRIPT:NoticeboardMarket_Beacons
"Venture to the Fourth level for the weekly market\nLocal produce, crafts and other rarities\nArvedui's Square, 4th Level, South Quarter"
END

SCRIPT:NoticeboardLibrary_Beacons
"Reading is a valuable skill and a great way to enrich your life.\nKnowledge and tales of old await you at the Library\nFifth Level"
END

SCRIPT:NoticeboardStables_Beacons
"For Sale: Trusty Mare of Halifirien stock\nChestnut with white patches\nInquire at the City Stables\nFourth Level, near the South Gate"
END

SCRIPT:NoticeboardSmith_Beacons
"Visit the Harlond Hammer for quality weapons and armor!\nHorseshoes, chains and metalwork\nSpecial discount this week only"
END

SCRIPT:NoticeboardHealers_Beacons
"Salves, remedies and dressings\nHealing advice on the first and fifteenth of each month\nAsk for Sister Elinor at the Houses of Healing, Fifth Level"
END

SCRIPT:NoticeboardTraveller_Beacons
"A trustworthy escort is sought for a journey from Minas Tirith to Dol Amroth.\nThe roads grow treacherous - reward offered to those who can ensure safe arrival.\nIf you deem yourself a skilled and vigilant companion, leave word at the noticeboard at the White Swan Inn."
END